resolution: "Delivered by PR #208, merge 11607ad5e9f5a841768a8e47bb91b0970c38091d, merged 2026-10-25T18:36:20Z. backend-capabilities.ts uses PmClient.listAllComplete/get; diagnostic-probes.ts uses listAllItemMetadata while retaining raw scope checks and fresh verifyHistoryEntries. test/backend-capabilities.test.ts and test/diagnostic-plans.test.ts exercise non-git read-only sources, identity refusals and corruption after cache priming. docs/sdk-adoption-1025.md retains differential and behavioural revert receipts."
